# Normalize line endings to LF on checkout across all platforms. The Windows CI
# job (and any Windows contributor) must get byte-identical fixtures — several
# test/fixtures/* are parsed/decoded and the bridge prebuild does byte cmp of
# copied sources, so CRLF conversion would be a portability hazard.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.vsix binary
